  "_about": "Launch bed 'Signal'. D minor, 100 BPM, 4/4. Every sound is an Auracle preset played through LivePoly. Render: cargo run --release -p auracle-wasm --example score -- www/video/sound/signal.json <out_dir>. Bars and beats are 1-based within each section; pitches are written as they sound (a track's transpose maps them onto the keys its preset needs).",
  "_harmony": "Progression, one chord per bar: Dm9 | Bbmaj7 | Fmaj7/A | C6sus2. Pad voicing (4 voices, rootless over the bass): F3 C4 E4 A4 | F3 Bb3 D4 A4 | F3 C4 E4 A4 | G3 C4 D4 A4. A4 is held on top throughout, the inner voices move by step (C-Bb and E-D in parallel thirds, F-G against E-D in contrary motion), so no two voices ever move in parallel fifths. The intro adds the root (D3) because there is no bass yet. The finale's last bar is Dm(add9): D3 F3 D4 E4 A4 over D2.",
